## Missions (Phase 5)
cl.missao.painel.titulo=Sunlight
cl.missao.painel.desc=Craft a Solar Panel (glass, lapis, redstone and copper) and place it under open sky.
cl.missao.bateria.titulo=Storing power
cl.missao.bateria.desc=Craft a Battery (copper, redstone and iron) and place it touching the panel.
cl.missao.cabos.titulo=Wiring
cl.missao.cabos.desc=Place 8 Copper Cables (copper and redstone) to connect machines to the battery.
cl.missao.gerador.titulo=Power at night
cl.missao.gerador.desc=Craft a Coal Generator (iron, furnace, copper and redstone). It burns coal or wood.
cl.missao.moinho.titulo=Desert wind
cl.missao.moinho.desc=Craft a Windmill (sticks, planks, iron and redstone) and put it up high with its sides clear.
cl.missao.peneira_automatica.titulo=Automatic prospecting
cl.missao.peneira_automatica.desc=Craft an Automatic Sieve (iron, hopper, redstone, sieve and copper).
cl.missao.automacao.titulo=Production line
cl.missao.automacao.desc=Let the automatic sieve work: 64 blocks sifted near you.
cl.missao.turbo.titulo=Turbo
cl.missao.turbo.desc=Connect the Greenhouse or the Advanced Condenser to a battery: 10 powered cycles.

