## Missions (Phase 6)
cl.missao.cidade.titulo=Radio signal
cl.missao.cidade.desc=A radio signal is coming from an abandoned city. Go there (the Logbook shows where).
cl.missao.spawner.titulo=Cut off the source
cl.missao.spawner.desc=Break a Monster Generator (in cities and dungeons).
cl.missao.masmorra.titulo=Underground
cl.missao.masmorra.desc=Find an underground dungeon. Look for rings of chiseled sandstone in the sand: they are shafts.
cl.missao.destrocos.titulo=We are not alone
cl.missao.destrocos.desc=Find the wreckage of another ship.
cl.missao.tempestade.titulo=Weather the wind
cl.missao.tempestade.desc=Survive a sandstorm.
cl.missao.exterminador.titulo=Exterminator
cl.missao.exterminador.desc=Break 5 more Monster Generators.
cl.missao.profundezas.titulo=The depths
cl.missao.profundezas.desc=Find a deep dungeon, in the deepslate layer.
